iver anticipates Left. The equilibrium occurs when both players are indifferent between their strategies.\n\nFirst, let's set up the equations for the Server and the Receiver to be indifferent:\n\nFor the Server:\n\\[ 10q + 4(1-q) = 6q + 10(1-q) \\]\n\nSimplifying the equation:\n\\[ 10q + 4 - 4q = 6q + 10 - 10q \\]\n\\[ 6q + 4 = 10 - 4q \\]\n\\[ 10q = 6 \\]\n\\[ q = 0.6 \\]\n\nFor the Receiver:\n\\[ 2p + 8(1-p) = 6p + 2(1-p) \\]\n\nSimplifying the equation:\n\\[ 2p + 8 - 8p = 6p + 2 - 2p \\]\n\\[ -6p + 8 = 4p + 2 \\]\n\\[ -10p = -6 \\]\n\\[ p = 0.6 \\]\n\nTherefore, in the mixed-strategy Nash equilibrium, the Server aims Left with a probability of 0.6.","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 0.4","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])0?\\.40*(?!\\d)"}],"nearMisses":[{"slip":"percent-for-decimal","credit":0.5,"pattern":"(?<![\\d.])40(?:\\.0*)?\\s*%"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":[],"failed":["equals 0.4"],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":6.615,"prompt_tokens":184,"generation_tokens":276}},{"item_id":"econ_mixed_receiver_prob_left","prompt_name":"econ_mixed_receiver_prob_left","family":"econ-mixed","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"0.4","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 0.6","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])0?\\.60*(?!\\d)"}],"nearMisses":[{"slip":"percent-for-decimal","credit":0.5,"pattern":"(?<![\\d.])60(?:\\.0*)?\\s*%"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":[],"failed":["equals 0.6"],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.524,"prompt_tokens":185,"generation_tokens":3}},{"item_id":"econ_mixed_server_value","prompt_name":"econ_mixed_server_value","family":"econ-mixed","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"6.6","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 7.6","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])7\\.60*(?!\\d)"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":[],"failed":["equals 7.6"],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.5